# Opt-out marker for ~/.claude/hooks/scripts/auto-format.py.
#
# This file's presence tells the global PostToolUse auto-format hook to skip
# every file under this directory tree.
#
# Why: swift-format's engine-level canonicalizations (guard-clause alignment,
# multi-line argument paren-alignment, multi-line string body indentation,
# binary-operator spacing, if/switch-expression layout) have no config knobs.
# The Fetch codebase predates the formatter and uses Xcode-style 4-space +
# 6-space hanging-paren alignment that swift-format wants to rewrite.
#
# We rejected the "reformat the codebase" path (would pollute git blame on
# 21 files) and the "config-only" path (proven impossible — see
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-06-download-success-oracle-design.md
# decision log). The opt-out preserves the existing style.
